m it. Palette: red arrows #E8232A, beam #F2D98C, glow #FFF2A0, disc rims and tube hardware #A8A8A8, tube green tint #BFD2BC, text charcoal #222222. Sign convention: positive sample rotation tilts the arrow clockwise as seen by the observer looking back toward the source (dextrorotatory).",
